 first ready task. changed is false when you already hold it. On GitHub and GitLab the assignee write is last-write-wins, not compare-and-set.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"agent":{"description":"rtok agent id; defaults to RTOK_AGENT_ID","type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"task_claim"},{"description":"Clear the assignee and set the task open. Only the holder, unless force.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"agent":{"type":"string"},"force":{"type":"boolean"},"id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id"],"type":"object"},"name":"task_release"},{"description":"Record that id waits on blocker. A cycle is refused and nothing is written.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"blocker":{"type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","blocker"],"type":"object"},"name":"task_dep"},{"description":"Set priority from 0 (highest) to 4. 2 is the default and is not stored.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"level":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","level"],"type":"object"},"name":"task_priority"},{"description":"Record that id and other touch the same files, so they should not run at once (symmetric; remove takes it off). task_ready flags a task whose conflict partner is in progress.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"other":{"type":"string"},"remove":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["id","other"],"type":"object"},"name":"task_conflict"},{"description":"Mark a task safe to run beside any other task; on false takes the mark off.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"on":{"description":"default true","type":"boolean"}},"required":["id"],"type":"object"},"name":"task_parallel"},{"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Read a file; mode full|lines|map|signatures|diff|stripped; range a-b for full|lines|stripped.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"mode":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"range":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"name":"read"},{"annotations":{"readOnly